{
  "id": "drop_settle",
  "kind": "motion",
  "description": "The subject drops in from above and lands with 0-3 soft bounces, slowed so the weight reads, then holds in its rest pose. For small products (a sneaker, a bottle, a watch), never a car. heightFrac 0.4-0.8 of its height, one bounce, timeScale 0.4-0.5. The camera holds or pushes gently while it lands.",
